<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Spencer returns three months after her first visit. She has had sixteen CBT-E sessions and is now working with her therapist on her concerns about shape and weight and on binges that follow difficult days. She has had two episodes of binge eating with vomiting in the last four weeks, both after long working days. She eats three meals and two snacks on six or seven days a week. She saw a dentist three weeks ago: the erosion was confirmed, a fluoride varnish was applied, no new decay was found, and a review was set for six months. She takes fluoxetine 60 mg each morning and an over-the-counter folic acid tablet. She completed the mid-treatment EDE-Q with her therapist. Her mood is good and she has had no thoughts of suicide or self-harm. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Binge eating and vomiting</td><td>Two episodes in the last four weeks</td></tr><tr><td>CBT-E</td><td>Sixteen sessions; weekly</td></tr><tr><td>Regular eating</td><td>Three meals and two snacks on six or seven days a week</td></tr><tr><td>Dental examination</td><td>Done three weeks ago; fluoride varnish; review in six months</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>Good; PHQ-9 5; item 9 scored 0</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

