    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Energy good; weight steady</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Two episodes of vomiting in four weeks; no heartburn or abdominal pain</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>Tooth sensitivity better since the varnish</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

